      "html": "<ul><li>Type: Rosulate</li><li>Origin: North America</li><li>Growth rate: Medium</li><li>Height: 20 - 30+ cm</li><li>Light demand: Low</li><li>CO2: Low</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Echinodoruscordifolius'Fluitans'(073D)/4519",
      "html": "<p>A comparatively fast-growing Echinodorus from Mexico, suitable for large aquariums, reaching leaves 20-50 cm long and a rosette 15-30 cm wide. Easy and undemanding, an excellent plant for beginners. Its wavy, light green leaves are very decorative. Unlike other round-leafed varieties of the species, Echinodorus cordifolius 'Fluitans' is less likely to grow up over the water surface. If it grows large enough, it forms large leaves just under the surface instead.</p>"
    }
